# Never use Grok

Do not use Grok for any work in this project.

- Do not set a Task/subagent `model` to any Grok slug (`cursor-grok-*`, `grok-*`, or similar).
- Use `inherit` or a non-Grok model the user requested.
- Do not recommend, default to, or fall back to Grok.
